# C-06  Device maintenance via jump host  [owner BIO, review Q]
#   NGFW layer (Suricata/Zenarmor, not pf): user=GRP_BIOMED
pass in quick log proto tcp from <Z_CLINICAL> to <H_JUMP> port 3389 keep state label "C-06"

