#   NGFW layer (Suricata/Zenarmor, not pf): app_block=ssh,openvpn,tor,remote-access; profiles=url,file,ips; tls_inspect=True
pass in quick log proto tcp from <Z_CLINICAL> to <internet> port { 80 443 } keep state label "C-07"
pass in quick log proto udp from <Z_CLINICAL> to <internet> port 443 keep state label "C-07"

# C-08  Clinical default deny  [owner NUR, review Q]
block in quick log from <Z_CLINICAL> to any label "C-08"

# GW-01  No internal reach  [owner FAC, review Q]
block in quick log from <Z_GUEST> to <N_RFC1918> label "GW-01"

# GW-02  Internet only (brief)  [owner FAC, review Q]
#   NGFW layer (Suricata/Zenarmor, not pf): app_block=tor; profiles=url; shaper=5Mbit/client
