pass in quick log proto udp from <Z_VENDOR_WIFI> to <internet> port { 53 443 500 4500 } keep state label "VW-02"

# VW-03  Vendor Wi-Fi default deny  [owner SEC, review Q]
block in quick log from <Z_VENDOR_WIFI> to any label "VW-03"

# RS-01  DNS and time  [owner RES, review Q]
pass in quick log proto tcp from <Z_RESEARCH> to <T_DNS_NTP> port 53 keep state label "RS-01"
pass in quick log proto udp from <Z_RESEARCH> to <T_DNS_NTP> port { 53 123 } keep state label "RS-01"

# RS-02  Inspected egress via proxy (brief)  [owner RES, review Q]
