# VM-02  Template: created per ticket, disabled otherwise  [owner BIO, review T]
#   NGFW layer (Suricata/Zenarmor, not pf): schedule=per-ticket
# DISABLED (template) pass in quick log from <H_JUMP> to <TICKET_DEVICE> port <set per ticket> label "VM-02"

# VM-03  Vendor default deny  [owner BIO, review Q]
